  "details": "I was sad to hear some movie worlds were taken down, but in light of this, I think you, VrChat have a golden opportunity to legitimise & potentially capitalise on the situation.\n\nI don’t know if the sale of goods and services are a thing yet in VrChat, but why not work WITH the movie companies, to allow a legitimate trending movie world, where users can potentially ‘rent’ (for a reasonable price) a selection of movies shown at the movie virtual theater or why not rent movies at a VR ‘Blockbuster’ in exchange for a working URL users can post in their private spaces? \n\nI know that VrChat has wanted to appeal to real world brands and companies, this is a golden opportunity.\n\nThere are people out there irl  with social anxieties & physical disabilities that may not ne able to get out to a Real world movie theater & it was really all about watching a movie with friends. And it was just the experience of it that brought us together, thats why these movie worlds were popular. \n\nLegitimising movie worlds & working with the movie companies instead of against them, work out an agreement, to which you can also profit in some way.\n\nI personally think its a ‘Win Win’ and an exciting enterprise that is just new and never been done on this scale before.",
